<view class="page">
  <view class="page-title">修改初始密码</view>
  <view class="page-desc">第一次使用需要换一个自己的密码：至少 8 位，且包含大写、小写和数字。</view>
  <view class="field">
    <view class="field-label">原密码</view>
    <input class="input" password value="{{oldPassword}}" onInput="onOld" />
  </view>
  <view class="field">
    <view class="field-label">新密码</view>
    <input class="input" password value="{{newPassword}}" onInput="onNew" />
  </view>
  <view class="btn" onTap="submit">保存</view>
</view>
